 {"value": "It depends on who your director is. Doing a t.v. show is an art in itself. Movies, it really depends on your director, I think. That's why Bob Altman is so prominent in my life. He would let you experiment. He said to me the first day, \"I want everybody to come to the dailies.\" I, like a lot of performers, hate to watch myself. I feel very self-conscious.I could have done that better or dah dah...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16079$1735C962-6D12-4526-B94E-01B75ABDC41F", "rank": "normal"}]}}